 161:main.c        **** //a/o v51: There've been some unusual testing in here...
 162:main.c        **** //         e.g. one of the first experiments was to use a dual-pixel
 163:main.c        **** //         display *directly* with the single-pixel GPU. Thus, the
 164:main.c        **** //         horizontal resolution, according to the computer, was 1/2 the 
